 "build": "necanyons",
 "note": "The necanyons kit's adapter onto the material library (core/materials/PLAN.md; biomes/necanyons/PLAN.md section 6). The host's layers (47-host-land.js): ground.litter (the floor's leaf litter), ground.talus (red soil at the walls' feet), ground.sand (the creek's banks), rock.wall (the mesas' and towers' walls: the owner's rock.sandstone.varnish), rock.stack (the stacks' cross-bedded walls), rock.top (every top: the owner's ground.slickrock; a bench's top reddened by vertex colour). The kit's slots (BIO.libSwap, 50-biome-necanyons-species.js): the owner's carnivore sheets (sundew, cup, lobe: full colour, shown by cell through each item's own uv, not the pack's cell, because one sheet serves several items), card.carnivore.plants (sunpit) and card.moss.carnivorous (carnmoss) from the Throne, and the reused leaf, grass and flower cards (tinted grey, keep 0); the barks. Run python3 tools/textures/pack.py biomes/necanyons after any change, then python3 build.py. The owner's card.palm.fan (fan), card.flametip (flametip) and card.treelily (lilytuft) arrived 2026-10-25: full colour (keep 1: libCol shows them as they are), the fan and the tuft cut their middle cell in their own uv (cellUV: no pack cell, or the cut is taken twice), the flametip's clump by its pack cell (a flush with flowers). rock.sandstone.bedded.red (section 5) for the bedded walls when it lands. The final rebuild (2026-10-27): rock.tepui (rock.quartzite.tepui) for station 2's tepui tables (a record's wallLib), ground.savanna (ground.savanna.litter) for station 3's savanna floor (LAND.ground.base).",
